# Cartographer Backend

## Stack

- Flask + `uv` (`pyproject.toml`)
- Secrets only in backend `.env`: `GEMINI_API_KEY`, `GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY`, optional `GEMINI_MODEL`

## Search jobs

- `POST /api/searches` — create job from NL query + area
- `GET /api/searches/:id` — status, progress 0–1, accumulating detections, error
- Lifecycle: queued → running → completed | failed
- Run pipeline in a background worker; append detections as samples finish

## Pipeline modules

- `geo/sampling` → `imagery/street_view` → `detection/gemini` → job store
- Cap sample density; skip points with no Street View imagery
- Gemini returns structured JSON; only emit real positives with usable confidence
- Default model: `gemini-2.0-flash` (override with `GEMINI_MODEL`)

## Safety

- Never expose API keys to the frontend
- CORS only for local Vite origin in development
- Clear errors when keys or APIs are misconfigured
